25-06-30", "new_period_end_date": "2026-06-30"}], "operational_highlights": ["Group revenue Rs.4.996bn, down 3% YoY; gross profit Rs.595.0mn, down 5% YoY", "Results from Operating Activities Rs.243.7mn, down 16% YoY -- the core operating decline", "PBT roughly flat (+1% YoY, Rs.282.2mn to Rs.284.5mn) only because net finance income swung from a Rs.10.7mn cost to a Rs.57.3mn gain, as finance income nearly tripled (Rs.88.4mn to Rs.256.6mn)", "By segment: Rubber gross margin compressed from 9.8% to 7.4% of revenue; Tea (largest segment) roughly stable; Others grew both revenue (+41%) and gross profit (+6%)", "Profit attributable to equity holders +2% YoY (Rs.187.7mn to Rs.192.4mn) while non-controlling interest's share of profit fell 54% (Rs.5.7mn to Rs.2.6mn)", "First interim dividend of Rs.0.30/share declared (2025/26: Rs.0.60/share)"], "key_drivers": ["The PBT 'flat' headline is mechanically driven by a large finance-income swing (Rs.88.4mn to Rs.256.6mn, +190% YoY), not core operating performance, which actually declined 16% YoY at the Results from Operating Activities line", "Rubber segment gross margin fell from 9.8% to 7.4% of revenue, with segment revenue down 6.3% and gross profit down 29.4% YoY -- the weakest segment this quarter", "Tea segment (the largest, ~90% of Group revenue) saw revenue fall 2.8% and gross profit fall 3.6% YoY -- broadly proportionate, not a margin story on its own"]}], "shareholder_info": null, "price_history": [{"as_of": "2026-07-14", "price": 84.7, "closing_price": 84.7}, {"as_of": "2026-07-15", "price": 84.7, "closing_price": 84.7}, {"as_of": "2026-07-16", "price": 84.0, "closing_price": 84.0}, {"as_of": "2026-07-17", "price": 85.5, "closing_price": 85.5}, {"as_of": "2026-07-18", "price": 82.6, "closing_price": 82.6}, {"as_of": "2026-07-19", "price": 82.6, "closing_price": 82.6}, {"as_of": "2026-07-20", "price": 82.6, "closing_price": 82.6}, {"as_of": "2026-07-21", "price": 82.8, "closing_price": 82.8}, {"as_of": "2026-07-22", "pric